RRULE:FREQ=MONTHLY;INTERVAL=3;BYMONTHDAY=10
SUMMARY:Switzerland: AHV/IV/EO contributions: quarterly payment (payroll up
  to CHF 200\,000)
DESCRIPTION:Employers with an annual payroll up to CHF 200\,000 pay contrib
 utions quarterly. The latest payment date is always the 10th day after the
  end of the quarter\, e.g. contributions for the first quarter by 10 April
 .\nApplies to: Employers with an annual payroll up to CHF 200\,000\nNon-wo
 rking-day rule: check the source.\n\nSource: https://www.ahv-iv.ch/p/2.01.
 d\nDetails: https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/deadlines.html#switzerland\n
 \nFor information only\, not legal or tax advice. Dates follow the recurri
 ng rule stated by the source\; weekends and holidays are not applied. Sour
 ces last checked 5 October 2026.
URL:https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/deadlines.html#switzerland
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
