RRULE:FREQ=MONTHLY;BYMONTHDAY=10
SUMMARY:Switzerland: AHV/IV/EO contributions: monthly payment (payroll over
  CHF 200\,000)
DESCRIPTION:Employers with an annual payroll above CHF 200\,000 pay contrib
 utions monthly. The latest payment date is always the 10th day after the e
 nd of the month.\nApplies to: Employers with an annual payroll above CHF 2
 00\,000\nNon-working-day rule: check the source.\n\nSource: https://www.ah
 v-iv.ch/p/2.01.d\nDetails: https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/deadlines.htm
 l#switzerland\n\nFor information only\, not legal or tax advice. Dates fol
 low the recurring rule stated by the source\; weekends and holidays are no
 t applied. Sources last checked 5 October 2026.
